      "title": "Episode 12\n                Put the Title Right Here",
      "summary": "Episode 12\n                Put the Title Right Here\n            \n\n            \n                \n                    2020-08-12T00:00:00.000Z\n                \n                \n          \n          Hosted by Dr. Darren Pulsipher\n        \n            \n            \n            \n        \n\n        \n\n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                \n            \n\n            \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n\n                    \n                        Explore more in the episode archive.\n                    \n                \n            \n\n            \n                Coming Soon...Come back on 2020-08-12T00:00:00.000Zto see and listen to this amazing episode\n            \n        \n\n        \n            (function () {\n                const mediaRoot = document.getElementById('episode-media');\n                if (!mediaRoot) return;\n\n                const releaseDateValue = mediaRoot.getAttribute('data-release-date');\n                const releaseDate = releaseDateValue ? new Date(releaseDateValue) : null;\n\n                const video = mediaRoot.querySelector('.video-container');\n                const audio = mediaRoot.querySelector('.podcast-container');\n                const comingSoon = document.getElementById('coming-soon');\n\n                if (!releaseDate || isNaN(releaseDate.getTime())) {\n                    if (comingSoon) comingSoon.hidden = false;\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                const today = new Date();\n                today.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);\n                releaseDate.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);\n\n                const isReleased = releaseDate <= today;\n\n                if (video) video.hidden = !isReleased;\n                if (audio) audio.hidden = !isReleased;\n                if (comingSoon) comingSoon.hidden = isReleased;\n            })();\n        \n\n        \n            Summary\n            On our last episode, Erin Moseley, Sr. Account Exec for Education at Intel, and Grant Kelly, Solution Architect for Education at Intel joined Darren to talk about the technological challenges and options in distance learning. In this episode, we delve more deeply into privacy and security threats an\n\n\n            \n            \n                \n                generativeai\n                \n                multicloud\n                \n                zerotrust\n                \n                moderncomputing\n                \n                cloudsecurity\n                \n                dataprivacy\n                \n                devops\n                \n                aiethics\n                \n                cybersecurity\n                \n                people\n                \n                process\n                \n                policy\n                \n            \n            \n\n            \n            \n                \n                \n              \n                Darren W Pulsipher\n              \n            \n                \n                \n              \n                Erin Moseley\n              \n            \n                \n                \n              \n                Grant Kelly\n              \n            \n                \n            \n            \n        \n\n        \n            Title\nTagline\nSummary here\n\nEpsiode Body here.\nMedia",
