      "title": "Episode 4\n                Architecture as the Missing Layer in Transformation",
      "summary": "Episode 4\n                Architecture as the Missing Layer in Transformation\n            \n\n            \n                \n                    2026-01-28T02:48:31.019Z\n                \n                \n          \n          Hosted by Dr. Darren Pulsipher\n        \n            \n            \n            \n        \n\n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                \n\n                \n                    \n                    \n                    \n\n                    \n                        Explore more in the episode archive.\n                    \n                \n\n            \n                Coming Soon...Come back on 2026-01-28T02:48:31.019Zto see and listen to this amazing episode\n            \n        \n\n        \n            (function () {\n                const mediaRoot = document.getElementById('episode-media');\n                if (!mediaRoot) return;\n\n                const releaseDateValue = mediaRoot.getAttribute('data-release-date');\n                const releaseDate = releaseDateValue ? new Date(releaseDateValue) : null;\n\n                const video = mediaRoot.querySelector('.video-container');\n                const audio = mediaRoot.querySelector('.podcast-container');\n                const comingSoon = document.getElementById('coming-soon');\n\n                if (!releaseDate || isNaN(releaseDate.getTime())) {\n                    if (comingSoon) comingSoon.hidden = false;\n                    return;\n                }\n\n                const today = new Date();\n                today.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);\n                releaseDate.setHours(0, 0, 0, 0);\n\n                const isReleased = releaseDate <= today;\n\n                if (video) video.hidden = !isReleased;\n                if (audio) audio.hidden = !isReleased;\n                if (comingSoon) comingSoon.hidden = isReleased;\n            })();\n        \n\n        \n            Summary\n            Digital transformation continues to struggle—not because organizations lack technology, but because they misunderstand the real impediments to change. In this episode of Digital Transformation Architect, Dr. Darren Pulsipher revisits the foundational constraints of desirability, feasibility, and via\n\n            \n                \n                \n              \n                Darren W Pulsipher\n              \n            \n                \n            \n            \n        \n\n        \n            Intent\nIntroduce architecture as a governing system, not documentation.\nThis is the conceptual pivot of the series.\nCore Questions\nWhat role should architecture actually play?\nWhy documentation-based architecture fails\nHow architecture governs coherence over time\nConcept Flow\nArchitecture vs architecture artifacts\nArchitecture as decision constraint\nAlignment across strategy, execution, and governance\nArchitecture as a continuous discipline\nPreparing for ODXA as a response\nWhitepaper Source\nSection 4 (Architecture as Missing Layer)\nEnables Later\nArticle: “Architecture Is Not Documentation”\nPrepares audience for ODXA introduction\nBridges theory to structural solution",
