      "title": "Untitled",
      "summary": "Biography\n            Proven technology leader and mentor with 22 years of experience in the Wireless Networking Industry for US Military Applications and Commercial Cellular Network Design. Focused on design and development of products for delivery into the US Defense Industrial Base to promote information sharing and situational awareness in a data centric environment via advanced wireless technology architectures.",
