      "title": "Untitled",
      "summary": "Biography\n            Seasoned product leader Drew Falkman's expertise circles around AI, product, startups, and innovation.\nKey Experience:\n\nCEO of frens, a Web3 community growth platform, Drew cultivated brand communities.\nAdjunct Instructor at LinkedIn, Drew channels his knowledge into courses like The Chief Technology Officer Career Guide, AI for Product Designers, and Data-Driven Product Management.\nDirector, Product Strategy/Strategy at Modus Create, he spearheaded a product strategy consulting practice with a fast-paced growth trajectory.\n\nWith a legacy of successful product launches, for companies ranging from HP to Adobe to numerous other companies and startups, Drew has a breadth and depth of experience and skills in strategy and execution of successful innovative technology products.",
