      "title": "Untitled",
      "summary": "Biography\n            Chris Lehman joined Verge.io in late 2021 as the Sr Vice President of Sales with Verge.io.  In his role, Chris is responsible for all Direct and Indirect Sales; Revenue Forecasting, Partnerships and a member of the Executive Team.  Prior to  joining Verge.io, Chris has spent 25 years in sales leadership roles in growth stage companies.",
      "id": 862,
